# The 320 kbps Interstellar release: 216 MB, and only ever the master source
# for the transcode. What the project actually serves is ost/, an 87 MB 128 kbps
# re-encode of this, which IS tracked — production has no dev server, so the
# tracks have to reach the build machine. See the ost-assets plugin in
# vite.config.ts and scripts/transcode-ost.sh.
